@{
    Layout = null;
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Bài tập : Tạo các mẫu Table</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 20px;
        }

        h2 {
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        h3 {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* ===== Bài 1 ===== */
        table.bai1 {
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

            table.bai1 th {
                background-color: #008284;
                color: white;
                font-style: italic;
                border: 1px solid white;
                padding: 6px 20px;
                text-align: center;
            }

            table.bai1 td {
                border: 1px solid white;
                padding: 6px 20px;
                text-align: center;
                color: white;
            }

                table.bai1 td.col1 {
                    background-color: #000084;
                }

                table.bai1 td.col2 {
                    background-color: #008284;
                }

        /* ===== Bài 2 ===== */
        table.bai2 {
            border-collapse: collapse;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

            table.bai2 th {
                background-color: #efefef;
                border: 1px solid #ccc;
                padding: 8px 12px;
                text-align: left;
                font-weight: bold;
            }

            table.bai2 td {
                border: 1px solid #ddd;
                padding: 10px 12px;
                vertical-align: top;
            }

                table.bai2 td.topic {
                    width: 55%;
                }

                table.bai2 td.num {
                    text-align: center;
                    width: 80px;
                }

                table.bai2 td.lastpost {
                    width: 160px;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    color: #555;
                }

            table.bai2 a {
                color: #0066cc;
                text-decoration: none;
                font-weight: bold;
            }

                table.bai2 a:hover {
                    text-decoration: underline;
                }

            table.bai2 .sub {
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #666;
                margin-top: 3px;
            }

            table.bai2 .icon {
                margin-right: 6px;
            }

        /* ===== Bài 3 - Bảng đỏ ===== */
        .bai3-wrapper {
            background-color: #c00000;
            color: white;
            width: 520px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        table.bai3 {
            border-collapse: collapse;
            width: 100%;
            color: white;
        }

            table.bai3 th {
                padding: 8px 12px;
                text-align: left;
                font-weight: bold;
                border-bottom: 1px solid #ff6666;
            }

            table.bai3 td {
                padding: 6px 12px;
            }

                table.bai3 td:nth-child(1),
                table.bai3 td:nth-child(2),
                table.bai3 th:nth-child(1),
                table.bai3 th:nth-child(2) {
                    background-color: #9b0000;
                }

                table.bai3 td:nth-child(3),
                table.bai3 th:nth-child(3) {
                    background-color: #ce4a4a;
                }

                table.bai3 td:nth-child(2),
                table.bai3 td:nth-child(3),
                table.bai3 th:nth-child(2),
                table.bai3 th:nth-child(3) {
                    text-align: center;
                    width: 110px;
                }

        .bai3-huongdan {
            background-color: #c00000;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 15px 15px 15px;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

            .bai3-huongdan p {
                margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            }

        .bai3-wrapper {
            background-color: #c00000;
            color: white;
            width: 520px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        table.bai3 {
            border-collapse: collapse;
            width: 100%;
            color: white;
        }

            table.bai3 th {
                padding: 8px 12px;
                text-align: left;
                font-weight: bold;
                border-bottom: 1px solid #ff6666;
            }

            table.bai3 td {
                padding: 6px 12px;
            }

                table.bai3 td:nth-child(2),
                table.bai3 th:nth-child(2) {
                    background-color: #9b0000;
                }

                table.bai3 td:nth-child(1),
                table.bai3 td:nth-child(3),
                table.bai3 th:nth-child(1),
                table.bai3 th:nth-child(3) {
                    background-color: #ce4a4a;
                }

                table.bai3 td:nth-child(2),
                table.bai3 td:nth-child(3),
                table.bai3 th:nth-child(2),
                table.bai3 th:nth-child(3) {
                    text-align: center;
                    width: 110px;
                }

        .bai3-huongdan {
            background-color: #c00000;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 15px 15px 15px;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

            .bai3-huongdan p {
                margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            }

        /* ===== Bài 4 ===== */
        .bai4-caption {
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            width: 700px;
        }

        table.bai4 {
            border-collapse: collapse;
            width: 700px;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

            table.bai4 th {
                background-color: #b8d4e8;
                border: 1px solid #99badd;
                padding: 8px 10px;
                text-align: center;
                font-weight: bold;
            }

                table.bai4 th:first-child {
                    text-align: left;
                    background-color: #d6eaf8;
                }

            table.bai4 td {
                border: 1px solid #ccc;
                padding: 7px 10px;
            }

                table.bai4 td:first-child {
                    font-weight: bold;
                    background-color: #f0f7fc;
                    width: 160px;
                }

            table.bai4 tr:nth-child(even) td:not(:first-child) {
                background-color: #f8fbfe;
            }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h2>Bài tập : Tạo các mẫu Table</h2>

    <h3>Bài 1</h3>
    <table class="bai1">
        <tr>
            <th>header1</th>
            <th>header2</th>
            <th>header3</th>
            <th>header4</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="col1">column1</td>
            <td class="col2">column2</td>
            <td class="col2">column3</td>
            <td class="col2">column4</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="col1">column1</td>
            <td class="col2">column2</td>
            <td class="col2">column3</td>
            <td class="col2">column4</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="col1">column1</td>
            <td class="col2">column2</td>
            <td class="col2">column3</td>
            <td class="col2">column4</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="col1">column1</td>
            <td class="col2">column2</td>
            <td class="col2">column3</td>
            <td class="col2">column4</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Bài 2</h3>
    <table class="bai2">
        <tr>
            <th>Topic</th>
            <th>Posts</th>
            <th>Views</th>
            <th>Last Post</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="topic">
                <span class="icon">🔒</span>
                <a href="#">Posting Guidelines</a>
                <div class="sub">Posted in <a href="#">Please Read First!</a> by Joe Gillespie</div>
            </td>
            <td class="num">1</td>
            <td class="num">288</td>
            <td class="lastpost">
                Dec 21, 2003<br>
                by Joe Gillespie
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="topic">
                <span class="icon">🔒</span>
                <a href="#">Forum Rules</a>
                <div class="sub">Posted in <a href="#">Please Read First!</a> by Joe Gillespie</div>
            </td>
            <td class="num">1</td>
            <td class="num">2023</td>
            <td class="lastpost">
                Dec 21, 2003<br>
                by Joe Gillespie
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="topic">
                <span class="icon">💬</span>
                <a href="#">A suitable Word Template</a>
                <div class="sub">Posted in <a href="#">Web Design Software</a> by Wilson Lagg</div>
            </td>
            <td class="num">2</td>
            <td class="num">199</td>
            <td class="lastpost">
                Mar 28, 2008<br>
                by Shahzad Asif
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="topic">
                <span class="icon">💬</span>
                <a href="#">few HTML and CSS issues</a>
                <div class="sub">Posted in <a href="#">Layout</a> by Jade M</div>
            </td>
            <td class="num">3</td>
            <td class="num">1</td>
            <td class="lastpost">
                Mar 28, 2008<br>
                by Shahzad Asif
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Bài 3</h3>
    <div class="bai3-wrapper">
        <table class="bai3">
            <tr>
                <th>Ingredients</th>
                <th>serves 12</th>
                <th>serves 24</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>milk</td>
                <td>1 quart</td>
                <td>2 quart</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>cinnamon sticks</td>
                <td>2</td>
                <td>1</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>vanilla bean, split</td>
                <td>1</td>
                <td>2</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>cloves</td>
                <td>5</td>
                <td>10</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>mace</td>
                <td>10 blades</td>
                <td>20 blades</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>egg yolks</td>
                <td>12</td>
                <td>24</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>cups sugar</td>
                <td>1 ½ cups</td>
                <td>3 cups</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>dark rum</td>
                <td>1 ½ cups</td>
                <td>3 cups</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>brandy</td>
                <td>1 ½ cups</td>
                <td>3 cups</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>vanilla</td>
                <td>1 tbsp</td>
                <td>2 tbsp</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>half-and-half or light cream</td>
                <td>1 quart</td>
                <td>2 quart</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Freshly grated nutmeg to taste</td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="bai3-huongdan">
            <p>1. Combine milk and spices including vanilla bean in a heavy saucepan and let them infuse over lowest possible heat for 5 minutes. Meanwhile, combine yolks and sugar in a large bowl and whisk until mixed.</p>
            <p>2. Bring milk to a boil and gradually whisk it into the yolk mixture. Return the mixture to the saucepan. Cook over medium heat, stirring steadily with a wooden spoon, for 2 to 3 minutes, or until foam subsides and mixture thickens to consistency of heavy cream. (Mixture should thickly coat the back of a wooden spoon.) Do not boil, or mixture will curdle.</p>
            <p>3. Strain mixture into a large bowl and let cool to room temperature. Stir in rum, brandy, half-and-half, vanilla and nutmeg.</p>
            <p>4. Refrigerate eggnog for at least 2 hours, preferably overnight. Just before serving, dust top of eggnog with additional nutmeg.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h3>Bài 4</h3>
    <div class="bai4-caption">Table 1: Power Mac G5 tech specs</div>
    <table class="bai4">
        <tr>
            <th>CONFIGURATIONS</th>
            <th>DUAL 1.8GHZ</th>
            <th>DUAL 2GHZ</th>
            <th>DUAL 2.5GHZ</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>MODEL</td>
            <td>M9454LL/A</td>
            <td>M9455LL/A</td>
            <td>M9457LL/A</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>G5 PROCESSOR</td>
            <td>Dual 1.8GHz PowerPC G5</td>
            <td>Dual 2GHz PowerPC G5</td>
            <td>Dual 2.5GHz PowerPC G5</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>FRONTSIDE BUS</td>
            <td>900MHz per processor</td>
            <td>1GHz per processor</td>
            <td>1.25GHz per processor</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>LEVEL 2 CACHE</td>
            <td>512K per processor</td>
            <td>512K per processor</td>
            <td>512K per processor</td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>

